[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22400100_03_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22400100_03_0010","text":"呼——……哈——\n呼——……哈————"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22400100_03_0020","text":"日花，紧张了吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22400100_03_0030","text":"…………能别跟我说话吗\n我在集中精神"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22400100_03_0040","text":"……嗯\n没问题的，日花"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22400100_03_0050","text":"……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22400100_03_0060","text":"今天不是最后一天"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22400100_03_0070","text":"想跳多少次都可以，想唱多少次都可以"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22400100_03_0080","text":"……衣服，很合适哦"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22400100_03_0090","text":"………………我出发了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22400100_03_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22400100_03_0100","text":"那句话……\n等看完舞台再说吧"}]
